## Where to read it next time

Portable TeamViewer is **not** under Program Files. Do not recurse `C:\`/`D:\` over WinRM for `TeamViewer.ini` (hangs the cabinet).

Read over SMB (cmdkey first):

`\\<ip>\c$\Users\goldclub\AppData\Local\TeamViewer\Logs\TeamViewer15_Logfile.log`

Grep the latest of:

- `Login::Identify::ManageLogin(): ID: <n>`
- `clientId [<n>]`

On `.111`, `...\TeamViewer\TeamViewer_HKCU.reg` had no `ClientID`.
